:svc-bgv-api a dcat:DataService ; dcterms:title "BGV-UPM lookup API (api-local)"@en ; dcat:endpointURL <https://bgv.linkeddata.systems/api-local/> ; dcat:endpointDescription <https://bgv.linkeddata.systems/api-local/swagger> ; dcterms:publisher :publisher-bgv .

